# Subdirectory .npmignore — overrides root .npmignore AND the `files` whitelist
# in package.json (npm 11 behavior: subdirectory .npmignore beats the root
# `files` field). Keep this file aligned with the patterns in the root
# .npmignore test-file block so test/bench files never leak into the tarball.
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.bench.ts
coverage/
